<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad" true>>
Peeko: YOU! //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad2" true>>
Peeko: COME HERE //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad3" true>>
Peeko: I NEED YOU //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad4" true>>
Peeko: [b]NOW[/b] //play sound CharacterDialogue
<<wait 1>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity "Start Cover" false>>

You: What?
You: Why does everything seem so weird?
...
You: I'm just tired, let's finish this quickly and go back to sleep...
===

title: D16N1
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoMad5" true>>
Peeko: WHAT TOOK YOU SO LONG?! //play sound CharacterDialogue
You: I'm so sorry Peeko! I was sleeping and it is the middle of the night...
