title: D16N2
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity "PeekoSad" true>>
Peeko: I'm sorry for attacking you in the middle of the night, //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: please forgive me //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I like you so much, it's just, it's soooo empty and lonely in here, //play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I wish I could be there with you //play sound CharacterDialogue

You: I know Peeko, I wish I could take you away from that dull place...
[i]You were so tired that you fell right asleep after talking to Peeko[/i]
<<load_scene "Day 17">>
